'''Aoi Hayakawa''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 6.8 grants the Long Distance ability, increases range and attack animation, but also increases time between attacks.

